questions.question:
Write the algorithm steps to find the closure of a set. Compute the closure of the following set F of functional dependencies for relation schema R = {A, B, C, D, E}. A→BC, CD→E, B→D, E→A.
R = {A, B, C, D, E}
A → BC, CD → E, B → D, E → A.

